1
00:00:00,259 --> 00:00:02,829
(Leonard:)Boy, that's a toughie.

2
00:00:02,895 --> 00:00:05,435
(Penny:)You still see her?

3
00:00:05,497 --> 00:00:07,437
(Leonard:)Well, no, not socially.

4
00:00:07,499 --> 00:00:08,669
(Leonard:)But, you know,
just at work.

5
00:00:08,734 --> 00:00:11,174
You work with her?!
(groans)

6
00:00:11,237 --> 00:00:12,737
How could you not tell me that?!

7
00:00:12,805 --> 00:00:15,275
(Leonard:)I wanted to tell you in the car,
but you told me to stop talking!

8
00:00:15,341 --> 00:00:16,911
(Penny:)Oh, okay. So you're saying
this is my fault?

9
00:00:16,976 --> 00:00:18,406
(Sheldon:)No, of course not.

10
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:20,047
(stammers) Okay, l-look,

11
00:00:20,112 --> 00:00:21,442
(Leonard:)instead of fighting,

12
00:00:21,513 --> 00:00:24,013
(Leonard:)why don't we dim the lights,

13
00:00:24,083 --> 00:00:27,923
(Leonard:)um, get naked and make a baby?

14
00:00:34,426 --> 00:00:37,296
(Leonard:)I was trying
to lighten the mood.

15
00:00:37,362 --> 00:00:40,632
(Leonard:)It's not easy. You try it.

16
00:00:41,899 --> 00:00:42,969
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello, Mother.

17
00:00:43,034 --> 00:00:45,234
(Mrs Cooper:)Shelly! How's my baby doing?

18
00:00:45,303 --> 00:00:46,703
(Sheldon:)I just wanted to let you know

19
00:00:46,771 --> 00:00:49,711
(Sheldon:)that you can remove Amy
from your nightly prayers.

20
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:51,504
(Sheldon:)Unless you're open
to praying for

21
00:00:51,576 --> 00:00:53,806
(Sheldon:)a beehive to fall on her head.

22
00:00:53,878 --> 00:00:56,008
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, what's going on?

23
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,310
(Sheldon:)She broke up with me.

24
00:00:57,381 --> 00:00:58,781
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, Shelly.

25
00:00:58,849 --> 00:00:59,579
(Sheldon:)No, I'll be okay.

26
00:00:59,649 --> 00:01:01,519
(Sheldon:)But I think that I'd like

